{"W":1440,"H":9252,"bg":"rgb(64, 0, 0)","out":[{"t":"p","r":[34,17,38,60],"tx":"A","fs":50,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[498,37,43,18],"tx":"HOME","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[565,37,53,18],"tx":"ABOUT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[642,37,65,18],"tx":"PROJECT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[731,37,35,18],"tx":"PLAY","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[790,37,68,18],"tx":"CONTACT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[882,37,58,18],"tx":"RESUME","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[84,155,1272,132],"tx":"krumble","fs":110,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[221,349,998,113],"tx":"A packaging design project reimagining Haldiram’s cookies as a premium, festive-ready gifting experience","fs":47,"al":"start","st":"italic","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[81,578,17,20],"tx":"00","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[82,637,1277,714],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/04.webp","nat":[2528,1696],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1387,34,20],"tx":"year","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"h1","r":[86,1390,728,270],"tx":"In India, cookies rarely make good gifts because their packaging seems too plain and functional. I reimagined Haldiram’s cookies as a festive gift, transforming a familiar product into a special keepsake for celebrations.","fs":36,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1417,291,35],"tx":"2025","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1483,76,20],"tx":"timeframe","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1513,291,35],"tx":"3 Weeks","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1579,42,20],"tx":"tools","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1609,291,35],"tx":"Photoshop , Illustrator","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1675,67,20],"tx":"category","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1705,291,35],"tx":"Packaging","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1771,109,20],"tx":"collaboration","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1801,291,35],"tx":"Individual Project","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"img","r":[85,1873,1271,1073],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/05.webp","nat":[1271,1101],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[213,2985,1015,175],"tx":"The existing Haldiram’s cookie packaging is functional but not memorable. Most designs rely on busy colours, flat layouts, and a strong focus on product display, which works for everyday retail but falls short for gifting. They lack warmth, presence, and a sense of occasion, making the experience feel transactional rather than celebratory. This absence of emotion and visual hierarchy created an opportunity to rethink the packaging as something more thoughtful and gift-worthy.","fs":20,"al":"left","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[83,3195,395,555],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/06.webp","nat":[395,555],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[535,3197,375,551],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/07.webp","nat":[375,550],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[967,3199,391,548],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/08.webp","nat":[391,547],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[218,3786,1004,175],"tx":"These sketches marked the starting point of the project, where I studied existing cookie packaging and identified gaps such as repetitive structures, plastic-heavy formats, and a lack of user experience or sense of occasion. By sketching current systems alongside new ideas, I explored silhouettes, opening mechanisms, materials, and more intentional forms. This phase focused on reimagining the cookie box as premium and gift-worthy, laying the foundation for the final packaging structure.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[82,4001,1277,253],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/09.webp","nat":[21167,4162],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[213,4295,1014,105],"tx":"The colour palette follows a flavour coding system, with each variant assigned a rich tone within the same warm family. Deep reds and burgundies create a premium, festive feel suited for gifting, while subtle shifts in shade distinguish flavours. This approach keeps the range cohesive, elegant, and instantly recognisable.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[84,4439,1272,899],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/10.webp","nat":[23385,16535],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[208,5377,1024,105],"tx":"To ensure the cookies remain intact from shelf to celebration, the packaging uses rigid chipboard. This choice provides superior structural integrity and impact resistance, ensuring that premium aesthetics are matched by a breakage-free experience.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[81,5521,17,20],"tx":"00","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[63,5580,674,822],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/03.webp","nat":[674,1006],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[747,5580,630,822],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/02.webp","nat":[630,940],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[83,6441,1274,884],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/11.webp","nat":[1274,1120],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[86,7375,1269,847],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/12.webp","nat":[1269,900],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[84,8271,67,20],"tx":"see also","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"img","r":[92,8323,302,117],"src":"assets/projects/haven/12.webp","nat":[302,191],"fit":"cover","mv":"anim","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[418,8344,874,20],"tx":"Branding","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"h3","r":[418,8363,874,56],"tx":"Thrive","fs":32,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"img","r":[92,8480,302,117],"src":"assets/projects/parde-ke-peeche/01.webp","nat":[302,201],"fit":"cover","mv":"anim","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[418,8501,874,20],"tx":"Publication Design","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"h3","r":[418,8520,874,56],"tx":"Parde Ke Peeche","fs":32,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"img","r":[92,8637,302,117],"src":"assets/projects/krumble/13.webp","nat":[302,187],"fit":"cover","mv":"anim","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[418,8658,874,20],"tx":"UI/UX","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"h3","r":[418,8677,874,56],"tx":"Haven","fs":32,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"anim"},{"t":"p","r":[108,8871,437,105],"tx":"A","fs":60,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""}]}